{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50901","headline":"赠浔阳冯明府 · 王贞白","name":"赠浔阳冯明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"政约人知惧，讼庭荒草生。\n日高诸吏散，风到七弦清。\n诗味匡山色，卧谙湓浦声。\n柴桑已不远，何苦念前程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}